# Dependencies
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# Build and generated outputs
**/dist/
**/build/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/coverage/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/target/
**/generated/

# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# OS and editor files
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/

# Misc
**/.vercel/
**/*.pem
